Adds node_modules/lodash@4.17.20 to app/frontend/package-lock.json (not
wired into package.json, osv-scanner reads the lockfile, not the import
graph). Verified live against api.osv.dev: 3 known advisories
(GHSA-29mw-wpgm-hmr9 CVSS 5.3, GHSA-35jh-r3h4-6jhm CVSS 8.1,
GHSA-f23m-r3pf-42rh CVSS 6.9, plus GHSA-r5fr-rjxr-66jc and
GHSA-xxjr-mmjv-4gpg), all fixed by 4.17.21 or 4.18.0. Feeds
gates/fixtures/vulnerable-dep in a later commit.

